    <briefdescription>
<para>Deprecated C++20 concept satisfied when <computeroutput>T</computeroutput> has a member named <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1value" kindref="compound">value</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
