    <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type to be checked.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
Restored with its v5.0.1 definition, satisfied by any type with a member named <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1value" kindref="compound">value</ref></computeroutput>, static or not, including the application types, so that the v5.0.1 code that uses it keeps its result. It is not the concept used by the framework, <computeroutput>detail::has_value</computeroutput>, which is satisfied only by the framework types, so that the application types with a <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1value" kindref="compound">value</ref></computeroutput> member are compared as values.</para>
<para><xrefsect id="deprecated_1_deprecated000040"><xreftitle>Deprecated</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>There is no replacement; the concept used by the framework is internal (since 5.1.0). </para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
